                        <p>Godwin records his death and there are  two meetings in 1811.    
    'stothard junr' is noted on 10 May 1830 but has not been coded.<lb/>
 In the <title>Farington Diary</title> index, Thomas Stothard
    is listed with the alternative spelling 'Stoddart'.    Given Godwin's long-standing friendship with <persName key="STO01">Stoddart</persName> , there is no reason to
    believe that Godwin would have confused them.
   </p>
